stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: Admin: POST /api/v1/platforms<br/>→ INSERT platforms (id, …, is_active=TRUE)

    Active --> Active: Admin: PUT /api/v1/platforms/{id}<br/>→ INSERT new platforms row sharing the same id<br/>(updated base_url / headers / certs)

    Active --> Inactive: Admin: DELETE /api/v1/platforms/{id}<br/>→ INSERT new platforms row with is_active=FALSE

    Inactive --> Active: Admin: POST again<br/>→ INSERT new row with is_active=TRUE

    note right of Active
        Latest platforms row for this id has is_active=TRUE.
        - Platform can register identifiers via POST /v1/identifiers
        - Latest-row lookup returns this platform
        - Platform users authenticate
        - Dataset requests routed to platform.base_url
        - supports_subsetting controls full-XML vs subset API
    end note

    note right of Inactive
        Latest platforms row has is_active=FALSE.
        - Latest-row lookup excludes this platform
          (filter is_active=TRUE)
        - Platform users get 401 (lookup fails)
        - Existing consignments rows remain in their own table;
          CronManager archives non-latest rows nightly.
        - The Inactive row stays for audit until archival sweep.
    end note
